              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Jarris, 'Seerri luba biraa, gorsi ogeeyyii biraa, dubbiin immoo raajota biraa waan hin dhabamneef kottaa Ermiyaasitti mariʼannaa; kanaafuu kottaa nu arraba keenyaan isa miinaa; waan inni dubbatu kam iyyuus hin fudhannu' \" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
